    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's exactly what i'm seeing. it's so subtle that most people would just call it \"updating the terminology,\" but it feels much more intentional. if this is indeed a deliberate effort to dilute these concepts, what do you think the ultimate goal is? like, why would someone go to the trouble of scrubbing the actual metadata at such a fundamental level?",
